OL,3,GNEWSAHarry Styles extends tour, with
OL,4,AKylie as a support act
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarry Styles is extending his
OL,7,Frecord-breaking Together, Together tour
OL,8,Fin 2027, with 25 more shows, including
OL,9,Fa return to Wembley Stadium next
OL,10,FAugust.
OL,12,FThe singer, who is currently in the
OL,13,Fmiddle of a 30-show residency at New
OL,14,FYork's Madison Square Garden, is adding
OL,15,Fdates in Ireland, Spain, Italy, Germany
OL,16,Fand France - who all missed out on the
OL,17,Ftour's first leg this summer.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
